### UStudent API - Enrollment Management Endpoints
### Base URL: http://localhost:8080

### Student 1 Enrolls in CS101
POST http://localhost:8080/api/courses/1/enroll?studentId=1

### Student 1 Enrolls in MATH101
POST http://localhost:8080/api/courses/3/enroll?studentId=1

### Student 1 Enrolls in CS201 (requires CS101 prerequisite)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/courses/2/enroll?studentId=1

### Student 2 Enrolls in CS101
POST http://localhost:8080/api/courses/1/enroll?studentId=2

### Student 2 Enrolls in CS201 (should fail - missing prerequisites)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/courses/2/enroll?studentId=2

### Test Duplicate Enrollment (should fail)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/courses/1/enroll?studentId=1

### Test Invalid Student ID
POST http://localhost:8080/api/courses/1/enroll?studentId=999

### Test Invalid Course ID
POST http://localhost:8080/api/courses/999/enroll?studentId=1

### Get Student 1's Enrolled Courses
GET http://localhost:8080/api/me/courses?studentId=1

### Get Student 2's Enrolled Courses
GET http://localhost:8080/api/me/courses?studentId=2